+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |  Sort: supplier.su_suppkey ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   Projection: supplier.su_suppkey, supplier.su_name, supplier.su_address, supplier.su_phone, revenue0.total_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |     Inner Join:  Filter: supplier.su_suppkey = revenue0.supplier_no                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |       TableScan: supplier projection=[su_suppkey, su_name, su_address, su_phone]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   |
|               |       Filter: revenue0.total_revenue = (<subquery>)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |         Subquery:                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |           Projection: max(revenue0.total_revenue)                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |             Aggregate: groupBy=[[]], aggr=[[max(revenue0.total_revenue)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: revenue0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                 Projection: supplier_no AS supplier_no, total_revenue AS total_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                   Projection: mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id,Int64(10000)) AS supplier_no, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS total_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |                     Aggregate: groupBy=[[mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000))]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                       Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id AND order_line.ol_supply_w_id = stock.s_w_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                         TableScan: order_line, full_filters=[order_line.ol_delivery_d >= Utf8("2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |                         TableScan: stock                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: revenue0                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |           Projection: mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id,Int64(10000)) AS supplier_no, sum(order_line.ol_amount) AS total_revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |             Aggregate: groupBy=[[mod(stock.s_w_id * stock.s_i_id, Int64(10000))]], aggr=[[sum(order_line.ol_amount)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: order_line.ol_i_id = stock.s_i_id AND order_line.ol_supply_w_id = stock.s_w_id                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                 TableScan: order_line projection=[ol_i_id, ol_supply_w_id, ol_amount], full_filters=[order_line.ol_delivery_d >= Utf8("2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                 TableScan: stock projection=[s_i_id, s_w_id]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=duckdb compute_context=//data/accelerated_duckdb.db base_sql=SELECT "supplier"."su_suppkey", "supplier"."su_name", "supplier"."su_address", "supplier"."su_phone", "revenue0"."total_revenue" FROM "supplier" INNER JOIN (SELECT mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) AS "supplier_no", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "total_revenue" FROM "order_line" INNER JOIN "stock" ON ((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_supply_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" >= '2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000')) GROUP BY mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000)) AS "revenue0" ON ("supplier"."su_suppkey" = "revenue0"."supplier_no") WHERE ("revenue0"."total_revenue" = (SELECT max("revenue0"."total_revenue") FROM (SELECT mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000) AS "supplier_no", sum("order_line"."ol_amount") AS "total_revenue" FROM "order_line" INNER JOIN "stock" ON ((("order_line"."ol_i_id" = "stock"."s_i_id") AND ("order_line"."ol_supply_w_id" = "stock"."s_w_id")) AND ("order_line"."ol_delivery_d" >= '2007-01-02 00:00:00.000000')) GROUP BY mod(("stock"."s_w_id" * "stock"."s_i_id"), 10000)) AS "revenue0" (supplier_no, total_revenue))) ORDER BY "supplier"."su_suppkey" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
+---------------+------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
